Package: treatledger
Type: Package
Title: Standardised Cumulative Treatment Exposure for Childhood Cancer Survivorship Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Nayiga Joselyn", "Mirembe", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "jnmirembe7@gmail.com")
Description: Calculates cumulative treatment exposures used in late-effects
    research on childhood cancer survivors from a simple table of treatment
    records. Provides the doxorubicin-equivalent anthracycline dose, the
    cyclophosphamide equivalent dose for alkylating agents (Green et al. 2014
    <doi:10.1002/pbc.24679>) and cumulative radiotherapy dose by body region.
    Conversion factors are stored as named, cited and versioned sets, including
    the Children's Oncology Group Long-Term Follow-Up Guidelines version 6.0
    factors and the estimates of Feijen et al. (2019)
    <doi:10.1001/jamaoncol.2018.6634>, and every result records the set used.
    For research use only; not for guiding individual patient care.
